          "text": "ezimpondweni eziyishumi ezazisekhanda laso, nezinye ezavelayo, ezawa phambi kwazo ezintathu; yebo lolo phondo olwalunamehlo, nomlomo owakhuluma izinto eziningi ezinkulu, okubonakala kwawo kwakunamandla kunezinye.",
