              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “Isilo sesine siyakuba ngumbuso wesine emhlabeni, oyakuhluka kuyo yonke imibuso, uqede wonke umhlaba, uwunyathele, uwuphule;",
          "type": "text",
