              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izimpondo eziyishumi kulo mbuso zingamakhosi ayishumi ayakuvela, kuvele enye emva kwawo; futhi iyohluka kweyokuqala, futhi iyothobisa amakhosi amathathu.",
          "type": "text",
