        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi iyokhuluma amazwi amakhulu ngokumelene noPhezukonke futhi iqede abangcwele boPhezukonke futhi icabange ukuguqula izikhathi nemithetho, futhi kuyonikelwa esandleni sayo isikhathi nezikhathi nengxenye yesikhathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
